# Valgrind DRD suppressions for the races job (tests/threads.rs).
#
# Valgrind's default.supp suppresses every race whose top frame is in libc
# (drd-libc-stdio), because glibc's FILE functions lock with primitives DRD
# cannot intercept; fopen and fclose, for one, link each stream into a global
# list under such a lock. Its pattern names libc-2.*.so, which glibc stopped
# installing in 2.34, so this is the same suppression for libc.so.6.
{
   drd-libc-stdio-libc.so.6
   drd:ConflictingAccess
   obj:*/libc.so.6
}
